message: "If you use this dataset or software, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Infrastructure-Free UAV Phenotyping Dataset"
abstract: "A complete dataset and source code for UAV-based crop reconstruction and trait estimation using RGB imagery without Ground Control Points (GCPs) or RTK-GPS. Includes weekly UAV flights over rice fields, orthomosaics, DEMs, and phenotypic analysis spanning early, mid, and late growth stages."
